Subject: [PATCH] Upgrading to tika 3.2.2 (#133410)

---
 docs/changelog/133410.yaml                    |   5 +
 gradle/verification-metadata.xml              | 176 +++++++++---------
 modules/ingest-attachment/build.gradle        |  25 +--
 .../licenses/jsoup-LICENSE.txt                |  21 +++
 .../{tagsoup-NOTICE.txt => jsoup-NOTICE.txt}  |   0
 ...soup-LICENSE.txt => pdfbox-io-LICENSE.txt} | 143 ++++++++++++++
 .../licenses/pdfbox-io-NOTICE.txt             |  22 +++
 .../ingest/attachment/TikaImpl.java           |   3 +-
 8 files changed, 294 insertions(+), 101 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 docs/changelog/133410.yaml
 create mode 100644 modules/ingest-attachment/licenses/jsoup-LICENSE.txt
 rename modules/ingest-attachment/licenses/{tagsoup-NOTICE.txt => jsoup-NOTICE.txt} (100%)
